 ],
 "strings": {
  "A girl named Sana is selling her CD in Theater Square. It costs 1,500 yen. Should I pick one up?": "",
  "Talk to Sana Again": "",
  "A street musician, huh? Wouldn't mind meeting her again.": "",
  "Ask Sana about the Offer": "",
  "It's pretty impressive that she's making her debut. I can meet Sana-chan at Tender or on Theater Avenue, so I should ask her what happened then.": "",
  "Investigate Saito": "",
  "I'm checking out Sana-chan's producer, Saito. Apparently he scouts in Theater Square often.": "",
  "Don't give up on your dream.": "",
  "Another Infidelity Investigation": "",
  "Listen to the Client at the Office": "",
  "I'll meet them at the office when I'm ready.": "",
  "Wait for a call from Seiya": "",
  "Seiya should be able to help me find Deguchi. I'll wait for a call back.": "",
  "Discover the Ghost's Identity": "",
  "Stay Away from the Drunk": "",
  "Some woman is hammered at Kanrai. The husband looks miserable, but it's not my business. Tooootally not my business.": "",
  "Speak with the Barker": "",
  "Some shady barker stopped me. Probably a scam.": "",
  "Request Complete": "",
  "Talk to the Bandit Chasers": "",
  "Ono Michio knocked off a store? I better get some details from those two.": "",
  "Defeat Kumakura": "",
  "I've been wanting to punch this guy for a while, actually.": "",
  "Wait for Sugiura to Get in Touch": "",
  "Sugiura is looking into the link between Kajihira and Minister Kazami. I'll kill some time till he calls.": "",
  "Head to Theater Square": "",
  "Still no word from Saori-san. I'll kill some time in Theater Square.": "",
  "Defeat the Thug": "",
  "Fine. I'll humor him.": "",
  "Defeat Ryan": "",
  "Why did it have to end up like this...?": "",
  "Defeat the Grown-ass Thug": "",
  "He must be pretty stressed out, huh? Maybe he'll calm down if I hit him.": "",
  "Defeat the Muscular Man": "",
  "This has gone too far. Sometimes you can only answer illogical people with illogical violence.": "",
  "Defeat the Dapper Yakuza": "",
  "These guys get angry too fast.": "",
  "Defeat the Dapper Yakuza Again": "",
  "These guys again? I'm not gonna let them waste my time.": "",
  "Catch the Dine-and-Dasher": "",
  "Hit Tanago": "",
  "A fight like this is kind of refreshing every once in a while.": "",
  "A fight like this can be kind of refreshing every once in a while, but I hope it doesn't become a regular thing.": "",
  "Defeat the Yakuza-esque Man": "",
  "Why does everyone in this city always try to solve things with their fists?": "",
  "Chase Shun": "",
  "Defeat the Keihin Gang Thugs": "",
  "Defeat the Keihin Gang Thug": "",
  "These guys are persistent... like cockroaches.": "",
  "Defeat Kabata": "",
  "Guess I better calm him down a bit.": "",
  "These guys again. I don't really want to waste my time on them.": "",
  "Defeat the Blonde Thug": "",
  "Come on... Does it always have to end in a fight?": "",
  "Amane's Request": "",
  "I should go speak to Amane.": "",
  "Amane-san wants me to tail a guy. Apparently she sees a black and white calamity would befall him. I'll go ask her about it when I get a chance.": "",
  "My Subordinate is Missing": "",
  "My client is Tanaka-san, who should be wearing a navy jacket over a purple shirt.": "",
  "A Dismemberment Case": "",
  "Talk to the Koi Bride Owner": "",
  "The Koi Bride owner has a case for me, and it's about... dismemberment? Yikes.": "",
  "Head to Smile Burger": "",
  "The suicidal cop's girlfriend is working at Smile Burger on Nakamichi Street.": "",
  "Tail the Two Potential Lovers": "",
  "Looks like Aoi is guilty... Sorry, man. Better get some photo evidence.": "",
  "Report the Investigation": "",
  "I'll get back up to that rooftop and give our boy the... great news...": "",
  "Looks like these guys want a fight. Fine.": "",
  "Accept Shin Amon's Duel": "",
  "Some weird dude I've never heard of challenged me to a duel. Guess I can accept it when I feel like it?": "",
  "Get two Bento": "",
  "The homeless guy wants a pork and a lunch bento set in exchange for info. I can pop over to the Poppo to get them.": "",
  "Defeat Ryuzenji": "",
  "A duel? What year does he think this is? But a challenge is a challenge, so I'll take it seriously.": "",
  "Maybe his stomach is where is where his brain should be.": "",
  "Pay Tsukumo": "",
  "Tsukumo can do it, but I'll need to pony up 100,000 for the costs of the wire.": "",
  "Rescue the Old Man": "",
  "An old man is sprawled out in the Children's Park. I should lend a hand.": "",
  "Find Mugwort for the Old Man": "",
  "The old man wants me to find some mugwort for him. Is that really the answer, though?": "",
  "Ring Thief and Koi Bride Sashimi Case": "",
  "Head to the Stardust Rooftop": "",
  "That's where my client is. It's a pain, but I should be able to get up the stairs at the back of the building next door.": "",
  "Return to the Office": "",
  "That was a close one. I'll head back to the office for now.": "",
  "Evade the Enemy and Escape": "",
  "The entire city wants my head. I need to stay out of sight and get somewhere safe.": "",
  "Go to Kim-san's Restaurant": "",
  "Kim-san probably knows about the Keihin Gang. I should ask him for advice.": "",
  "Gather Intel in Theater Square": "",
  "If I listen to the teens around Theater Square, maybe I'll pick up some info. Ugh. Teens.": "",
  "Find the Dealer": "",
  "If the intel's right, the dealer should show up anytime. He'll be wearing a red scarf.": "",
  "Search for the Gun Smuggler's Base": "",
  "The dealer disappeared from the Children's Park. According to Kasai, the base should be beneath it...": "",
  "Answer the Withheld Call": "",
  "This must be the serial bomber. Answering this is going to be a headache...": "",
  "It's gotta be the serial bomber again... Will he ever stop?": "",
  "Catch Zhuang Shi's Attention": "",
  "Zhuang Shi climbed up pretty high... Do I have anything that could reach him up there?": "",
  "Find Asami Morimiya": "",
  "All I've got to go on is Asami-san's phone number and email. I hope that's enough. Maybe I should get some professional assistance?": "",
  "Eavesdrop on Adachi": "",
  "Adachi knows my face. I need to get close to them carefully enough to eavesdrop.": "",
  "Buy a Figure for Tsukumo": "",
  "I should get something for Tsukumo as thanks. Ebisu would probably have something.": "",
  "Deliver Tsukumo's Figure": "",
  "I should give this to Tsukumo. He's probably at the Mantai Internet Café in Theater Square.": "",
  "Meet Dr. Moroboshi in the Sewer": "",
  "Apparently there's a doctor hiding in the sewers. I should be able to get down there from the Children's Park.": "",
  "The thief that stole the diamond ring bought a cooking knife. Are these cases related? I should ask about that other case while I'm at it.": "",
  "Leave Out the Backdoor": "",
  "Amour should have a backdoor. Hamura said he left the same way, so let's see it.": "",
  "Defeat the Tough Guy": "",
  "Okay, really? And for that matter, how can he tell the difference between Blue Mountain and Guatemalan in just one sip?": "",
  "Head to the Ushimata Family Office": "",
  "They're on East Taihei Boulevard. Maybe that's where Yusuke's dad is.": "",
  "The robber headed toward Charles, still dressed as Ono Michio. I should check in on that.": "",
  "Gather Intel at City Hangouts": "",
  "Maybe I'll find something interesting about the pistol smuggling. The map shows places where people tend to hang out.": "",
  "Gather Intel at Nyan Nyan Café": "",
  "The owner at Nyan Nyan Café would know about stray cats. I should head to the 3rd floor of that building on Senryo Avenue.": "",
  "Rescue Rei from the Boss": "",
  "Rei is being sexually harassed by Iseya! If I don't help her...!": "",
  "Amane-san wants me to tail a guy. She says she sees signs of a black calamity on him. I'll go ask her about it when I get a chance.": "",
  "Speak to Amane": "",
  "Amane-san wants me to tail a guy. She said she sees a sign of a fire calamity. I'll go ask her about it when I get a chance.": "",
  "Follow That Weird Thing": "",
  "A strange golden-colored object flew by me. What could it be? Should I go check?": "",
  "Follow The... Hat?": "",
  "That's Tokunaga-san's \"hat,\" right? Fine. I guess I'll pick it up for him...": "",
  "Please Find My Son": "",
  "Meet the client at Café Mijore": "",
  "An emergency job to find the client's son. Could he have been kidnapped? The client will be wearing a brown jacket, green slacks, and glasses. I should head over to Mijore.": "",
  "Please Find My Son Again": "",
  "Meet Ohata-san at Café Mijore": "",
  "Another job from Ohata-san. I guess Ayumu-kun is playing hide-and-seek again...": "",
  "Please Find My Son (Again)": "",
  "Another job from Ohata-san. Ayumu-kun always looks sad when I find him...": "",
  "Talk to the Punks at the Batting Center": "",
  "The young men we're looking for wanted to blow off steam by hitting some balls.": "",
  "Pay 100,000 and Modify the Drone": "",
  "According to Makihara-kun, I'll need 100,000 yen to modify and install a shooting mechanism on the Pigeon. I need to get 100,000 yen somehow. ": "",
  "Check on Nanami's situation through messaging": "",
  "Naname's kidnapped? What could have happened? I'll need to communicate with her to get more info.": "",
  "Investigate the Parking Lot": "",
  "So this is the parking lot where the truck Okubo-kun used to carry the body was parked. I hope I can find something...": "",
  "Talk with Terasawa": "",
  "I came here to look because Terasawa-san told me to, but I don't think I missed anything. I should call it a day.": "",
  "Head to Nakamichi Street": "",
  "Karin-chan headed toward Nakamichi Street. I need to go there and find Karin-chan.": "",
  "Choose the Next Stop": "",
  "Seems like everyone has their own plans. I'll go ask around for the details.": "",
  "I've done everything I need to do. I should swing back by the office.": "",
  "Talk to Sugiura (Daytime Only)": "",
  "I've pretty much done everything I can. Things are going to get busy, so I'd better take care of any loose ends now.": "",
  "I need to stop Kuroiwa, now. There has to be some other way to get to the research wing.": "",
  "Boost Health Lv. 1": "",
  "Increases maximum health.": "",
  "Always in effect.": "",
  "Boost Health Lv. 2": "",
  "Greatly increases maximum health.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Boost Health Lv. 1": "",
  "Boost Health Max": "",
  "Dramatically increases maximum health.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Boost Health Lv. 2": "",
  "Boost Attack Lv. 1": "",
  "Increases attack damage.": "",
  "Boost Attack Lv. 2": "",
  "Greatly increases attack damage.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Boost Attack Lv. 1": "",
  "Boost Attack Max": "",
  "Dramatically increases attack damage.": "",
  "Learning requirements: Boost Attack Lv. 2, Ferocity of the Tiger": "",
  "Boost Combo Speed Lv. 1": "",
  "Increases combo speed.": "",
  "Boost Combo Speed Lv. 2": "",
  "Greatly increases combo speed.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Boost Combo Speed Lv. 1": "",
  "Boost Combo Speed Max": "",
  "Dramatically increases combo speed.": "",
  "Learning requirements: Boost Combo Speed Lv. 2, Ferocity of the Tiger": "",
  "Blessing of the Wind God": "",
  "Enables you to sprint without flinching from enemy attacks whenever your health is low.": "",
  "You have not met the proper conditions. Use your camera to capture a 2D code somewhere in the city.": "",
  "Press <Sign:3> at low health.": "",
  "Blessing of the Thunder God": "",
  "Avoid being stunned by enemy attacks whenever your health is low.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Quickstep Strike": "",
  "Quickstep backwards and press <Sign:1> at low health.": "",
  "Dire Determination": "",
  "Enables you to repel enemy attacks by guarding while your health is in the red.": "",
  "<Sign:1> while <Sign:6> guarding at low health.": "",
  "Boost EX Gauge Lv. 1": "",
  "Charges up the EX Gauge faster.": "",
  "You have not met the proper conditions. Find the corresponding Skill Book somewhere in the city.": "",
  "Boost EX Gauge Lv. 2": "",
  "Charges up the EX Gauge even faster.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Boost EX Gauge Lv. 1": "",
  "Boost EX Gauge Max": "",
  "Charges up the EX Gauge faster than ever.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Boost EX Gauge Lv. 2": "",
  "Enhance EX Boost Lv. 1": "",
  "Reduces the amount of EX Gauge consumed and extends its duration.": "",
  "Enhance EX Boost Lv. 2": "",
  "Reduces the amount of EX Gauge consumed and extends its duration even further.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Enhance EX Boost Lv. 1": "",
  "Enhance EX Boost Max": "",
  "Reduces the amount of EX Gauge consumed and extends its duration to the max.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Enhance EX Boost Lv. 2": "",
  "Wall Jump Finisher": "",
  "A powerful finishing move unleashed from a Wall Jump. Allows you to stop a Deadly Attack.": "",
  "Press <Sign:1> right before you kick off the wall during a Wall Jump.": "",
  "Wall Jump Throw": "",
  "A powerful throw unleashed from a Wall Jump that takes out surrounding enemies. Allows you to stop a Deadly Attack.": "",
  "Press <Sign:0> right as you kick off the wall during a Wall Jump.": "",
  "Leapfrog": "",
  "Use enemies as stepping stones to hop over and get behind them.": "",
  "Press <Sign:3> while sprinting toward an enemy.": "",
  "Leapfrog Rush": "",
  "A quick attack unleashed from a Leapfrog. Allows you to get behind enemies while stunning them.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Leapfrog": "",
  "Press <Sign:2> while leapfrogging over an enemy.": "",
  "Leapfrog Finisher": "",
  "A powerful finishing move unleashed from a Leapfrog.": "",
  "Press <Sign:1> while leapfrogging over an enemy.": "",
  "Leapfrog Throw": "",
  "A powerful throw unleashed from a Leapfrog.": "",
  "Press <Sign:0> while leapfrogging over an enemy.": "",
  "Dash Attack": "",
  "Leap toward an enemy and knock them off balance. Alters a bit between combat styles.": "",
  "Press <Sign:1> while sprinting with <Sign:3>.": "",
  "Knockdown Reversal": "",
  "Immediately recover from being knocked down and unleash a swift attack.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Double Quickstep": "",
  "<Sign:1> right before getting knocked down.": "",
  "Rising Tornado": "",
  "Attacks enemies while getting back up from the ground.": "",
  "<Sign:1> while knocked down.": "",
  "Charging Tiger": "",
  "Build up power by holding <Sign:1> to unleash a devastating attack. You become less likely to flinch from attacks while charging. Tiger Style only.": "",
  "Hold down <Sign:1> during Strong Attacks.": "",
  "Re-Guard": "",
  "Shortens the time it takes to put your guard back up after your guard is broken.": "",
  "<Sign:6> again right after <Sign:6> guard is broken.": "",
  "Triple Finisher": "",
  "A third Finishing Blow unleashed after a Double Finisher.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Boost Combo Speed Lv. 2": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
